            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "busymom3"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Used the pressure cooker - 20 min for the beef/onions and broth (the beef was still partially frozen), release pressure, add the rest of the stuff, return to pressure and cook for 5 more minutes. I also added 1/4 head of chopped cabbage to the meat/onions. It disolved into the broth and served as a thickener. Yummy AND fast!",
