              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "thedailygourmet"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Like another reviewer, I cooked this in my instant pot. I realized potatoes can act as a thickener so didn't use any flour (or salt and pepper). I wasn't crazy about the addition of rice vinegar largely because it leaves too acidic a taste. I usually love curry, and I liked this but won't make it again.",
