              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LivelySoda4925"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I had to make some provisions. I didn't have white potatoes so, added one sweet potato instead. Didn't have quite enough curry, so added some garum masala, cumin and garlic powder. Had to thicken sauce a bit. Served over brown rice. Yummy.",
