            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Elaine"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for my husband who is allergic to soy and gluten intolerant. I omitted the flour, used beef short ribs instead of stew meat, and added some carrots. The results were amazingly tasty. It tastes even better than the curry prepared with the Japanese curry bricks. Very flavorful and easy to make. Thanks for sharing your wonderful recipe. I will definitely be making this again!",
